                                "sense_id": "7559b096-3f5f-399a-acfe-ae894a734714",
                                "text": "2002, Tom Grahn, \"Food compositions and methods of preparing the same\", US Patent 6814975 http://www.google.com/patents?id=spsQAAAAEBAJ, page 5,\nSecondary foodstuffs are exemplified by the following prepared dishes: vegetarian steaks, gratinated vegs, oven made lasagne, fish and ham with potatoes, […]"
                            },
