                                "example_id": "9ffd92b7-4bdb-43e7-aa81-252f19029e98",
                                "sense_id": "7559b096-3f5f-399a-acfe-ae894a734714",
                                "text": "[…] meals of meat and three veg were mostly the same three veg, beans peas potatoes, or peas carrots potatoes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "148b0107-52ea-4f34-8fe6-09b313d57fa5",
                                "sense_id": "7559b096-3f5f-399a-acfe-ae894a734714",
                                "text": "Ok, Question 40. Do you get your five fruit and veg?\nOhh, I mean I certainly try to... I would say, I would say I probably do.\nA day.\nA WHAT??!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "02b17a27-8c5a-469f-a755-3d147b516b52",
                                "sense_id": "7559b096-3f5f-399a-acfe-ae894a734714",
                                "text": "fruit and veg",
                                "translation": "fruit and vegetables",
